    {
      "name": "canvas_learn",
      "description": "PROTOTYPE learning mode. Use only when the person has asked to understand or learn something (on a frame brief or in the request), never by default. Places a prompt card and hides hideIds until the person answers or skips. mode predict: they guess before seeing the result. mode generate: they explain in their own words before seeing your explanation. Create the hidden result first, then pass its ID. Prompts never block: the person can skip in one click. Read the prompt's status and response afterwards; compare their answer with the outcome and critique it kindly, rather than restating your answer. You cannot answer a prompt.",
      "op": "learn",
      "output": "json",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
